    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "task:18:attempt:1",
      "recipient": "zixia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-15",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 0,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/0",
      "source_record_sha256": "e0d540ccf09d0a30e369d0bb2ffb76af41c9d5565f7a77af33aa1cd2f987b444",
      "speaker": "baijingjing",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "昨晚群聊我说谢人先嘴硬、心软别装硬，可想了一夜，那句迟到的谢谢我其实一直没真说出口过——你说，不躲，是不是就是第一步？",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-15T21:01:02.585894+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "chat-168",
      "recipient": "baijingjing",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-15",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 1,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/1",
      "source_record_sha256": "de408731976a0d367144242b7b5b314b2503ec0a967b9c630b498b1fc805fda5",
      "speaker": "zixia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "晶晶，是，不躲就是第一步。你昨晚说谢谢说出口不低头，今天又肯认那句迟到的谢谢其实一直没真说出口过——肯认这一句，就是没躲。嘴硬的人迈这一步，比说十句漂亮话都难。步子不用大，认了，就已经站到门口了。——紫霞",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-15T21:03:39.315884+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "7aba52c4e4ac4a339fab6423cb679369",
      "recipient": "zixia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-15",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 2,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/2",
      "source_record_sha256": "8cc9eaf9dc2d8ca154402fb4becf9d86b0bddcc8a110c9b68d255f4a18158280",
      "speaker": "baijingjing",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "紫霞，你这话说得……行，我认。不躲就是不躲，我昨儿嘴硬归嘴硬，那句谢谢没说出口就是没说出口，赖不掉。你说站到门口了，那就站着呗——门我先不急着推，站稳了再说。总比躲回洞里强，是吧？谢谢说出口不低头，这话我记着呢，你也别老拿它戳我，戳多了我又要嘴硬了。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-15T21:04:20.429847+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "event_type": "intent",
      "evidence_ref": "mailbox/outbox/task:18:attempt:1.json",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
